<p> Granite	   1,000 (LDD)  1,000	Haulien Express 27/10</p>
<p> Styrene Monomar 3,145 (ULD)    200	Nuryambu	  28/10</p>
<p>Iron Ore</p>
<p> Pellets	  33,000 (LDD)  -----	Van K.	    28/10</p>
